  "_comment": "Curated shortlist of the ~300 fragrance houses worth covering in Spritz, ordered by tier then by rough popularity within tier. Edit freely — `npm run match:shortlist` dedupes, resolves each name to a Fragrantica slug from data/houses.json, and flags anything it can't match. No network calls to Fragrantica.",
