    "3": "Middle Eastern / Gulf — huge scan volume, drives the dupes feature",
    "4": "Modern / TikTok-era — where new demand is being created",
    "5": "Secondary designer, celebrity and lifestyle — long tail of mall and drugstore shelves",
    "6": "Artisanal, indie and clone houses — depth for enthusiasts and the dupes engine",
    "7": "Ultra-niche — small-batch, cult, often direct-to-collector. Near-zero scan volume, high credibility with enthusiasts. Optional: scrape only if the encyclopedia positioning matters more than match rate."
